/* «ОР» for особистий рекорд, the way the English badge is «PR».

   THE TWO LABEL FORMS ARE ONE SENTENCE IN UKRAINIAN, AND THAT IS NOT AN OVERSIGHT. English splits
   them because «rep» agrees with the count; the compound «%@-повторний максимум» is an adjective
   and agrees with «максимум» instead, so it is correct at 1 and at 6 alike — where the literal
   «на %@ повторень» would be wrong at 2, 3 and 4, which are the counts a lifter sets most. */
"logging.session.set.record" = "ОР";
"logging.session.set.record.label %@" = "Особистий рекорд: %@-повторний максимум";
"logging.session.set.record.label.one %@" = "Особистий рекорд: %@-повторний максимум";
